现出一种“新中式”与“赛博朋克”碰撞的时尚感。\n\n构图采用中景半身视角，人物神情疏离且优雅。光影呈现出细腻的自然散射光，柔和地勾勒出人物的面部轮廓和精致的锁骨线条，捕捉到皮肤真实的纹理与丝绸面料的微光。配色方案以高级的古铜色、深巧克力棕和墨黑色为主调，点缀着灿烂的香槟金。背景是极简且带有模糊感的灰色水泥路面，带有细微的裂痕纹理，这种冷调的工业感背景完美烘托出主体的华丽与精致。整体风格融合了超写实主义与电影质感，细节极度丰富，呈现出高端时尚大片的视觉张力。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "id": 102, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "INT", "links": [96, 109], "label": "INT", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "整数"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [1080, "fixed"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "数值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveInt", "title": "width", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [323.84375, 82], "pos": [-283.4497985839844, 1023.2161865234375], "id": 85, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.76", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveInt"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [94], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [322.46392822265625, 143.703125], "pos": [650.7261352539062, 1489.6595458984375], "widgets_values": [1080, 1920, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 96, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "宽度"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 97, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "高度"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "批次大小"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 88, "type": "EmptyLatentImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.76", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptyLatentImage"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [107], "label": "Latent", "type